
@startuml
title 校园二手交易系统 - 创建预约时序图

autonumber

actor "买家" as Buyer
boundary "预约界面" as UI
control "BusinessWorkflowService" as Workflow
control "PermissionService" as Permission
control "ProductService" as Product
control "ReservationService" as Reservation
control "TransactionManager" as Transaction
control "OperationLogService" as Log

Buyer -> UI : 选择商品并提交预约
UI -> Workflow : createReservation(productId, buyerId)

Workflow -> Permission : 校验买家权限
Permission --> Workflow : 校验结果

alt 无预约权限
    Workflow --> UI : 返回权限错误

else 有预约权限
    Workflow -> Transaction : begin()
    activate Transaction

    Workflow -> Product : 检查商品最新状态
    Product --> Workflow : 商品状态

    Workflow -> Reservation : 检查有效预约及重复请求
    Reservation --> Workflow : 检查结果

    alt 商品不可预约或存在冲突
        Workflow -> Transaction : rollback()
        deactivate Transaction
        Workflow --> UI : 返回失败或已有预约结果

    else 可以创建预约
        Workflow -> Reservation : 创建预约并保存商品快照
        Reservation --> Workflow : 新预约记录

        Workflow -> Product : changeState(RESERVED)
        Product --> Workflow : 更新结果

        Workflow -> Log : record(预约创建成功日志)
        Log --> Workflow : 写入完成

        Workflow -> Transaction : commit()
        deactivate Transaction

        Workflow --> UI : 返回预约成功及预约编号
    end
end

UI --> Buyer : 显示预约结果

note over Workflow,Transaction
  商品状态更新、预约记录创建、
  成功日志写入在同一事务中提交。
  并发预约需要数据库层面的
  锁或唯一性约束保证一致性。
end note

@enduml